# Third-party data notice

The files under `data/samples/` are trimmed extracts from
[Splunk's `attack_data`](https://github.com/splunk/attack_data) corpus,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see `LICENSE`). All of it is
lab-generated/simulated attack-range traffic (RFC1918 addresses, lab
domains such as `attackrange.local`) - no production systems, real victims,
or real PII are represented.

